pt running like the bug displays.\n\nnsParser::Terminate is eventually called via nsDocShell::Destroy() also, but this way we ensure the above doesn't happen, provided that NS_BINDING_ABORTED is passed in.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D305221\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D309304\n", "files": ["parser/htmlparser/nsParser.cpp"], "git_node": "6ac9f260c383af8df427100f1d0d808b9d53954b", "git_parents": ["f19e087afdbf2b41aaedd35279c868d197d0489a"], "node": "1700c768a830e6597dd71f0734bc4841defe804f", "parents": ["5ff3a57143ae151b3d83a3c82d06ab29fa9c0636"], "tags": []}], "date": 1782869684, "git_changesets": ["6ac9f260c383af8df427100f1d0d808b9d53954b"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "1346": {"changesets": [{"author": "Valentin Gosu \u003cvalentin.gosu@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2041001 - Drop intermediary HTTPS result when following alias  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D308991\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D309322\n", "files": ["netwerk/dns/DNSPacket.cpp"], "git_node": "1efcbb188af7b558d38bc5076f174beac4f21172", "git_parents": ["6ac9f260c383af8df427100f1d0d808b9d53954b"], "node": "7665a594421b38a82a6c8746fb9f28ad05eb924d", "parents": ["1700c768a830e6597dd71f0734bc4841defe804f"], "tags": []}], "date": 1782869703, "git_changesets": ["1efcbb188af7b558d38bc5076f174beac4f21172"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "1347": {"changesets": [{"author": "Vincent Hilla \u003cvhilla@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2043820 - Reject javascript URI in nsDocShellLoadState.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D305829\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D309583\n", "files": ["docshell/base/nsDocShellLoadState.cpp"], "git_node": "adb17524a0de3c28afd91be184bb762c695641bb", "git_parents": ["1efcbb188af7b558d38bc5076f174beac4f21172"], "node": "0f67fdd73dcc2727dcad78022cdd721304a7ed05", "parents": ["7665a594421b38a82a6c8746fb9f28ad05eb924d"], "tags": []}], "date": 1782869722, "git_changesets": ["adb17524a0de3c28afd91be184bb762c695641bb"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "1348": {"changesets": [{"author": "Karl Tomlinson \u003ckarlt+@karlt.net\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2042242 Start fallback driver after queuing cubeb stream init  a=RyanVM\n\nThis keeps cubeb operations in order and means that no other thread runs the\ngraph while mStreamName is passed to the cubeb operation thread.\n\nMaybeStartAudioStream() no longer uses Start() to queue the stream init,\nbecause it does not need to and removing this caller allows Start() to more\nsimply handle its remaining use cases.  MaybeStartAudioStream() never starts a\nfallback driver nor stops a previous driver because it is called from the\nfallback driver loop.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D305794\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D309475\n", "files": ["dom/media/GraphDriver.cpp", "dom/media/GraphDriver.h"], "git_node": "8bc2bffb2a90f58678907b5e49f7330711eaf4fc", "git_parents": ["adb17524a0de3c28afd91be184bb762c695641bb"], "node": "e1f1a7ed5183b5ec34aa94e4448aaa9c90f41e16", "parents": ["0f67fdd73dcc2727dcad78022cdd721304a7ed05"], "tags": []}], "date": 1782945198, "git_changesets": ["8bc2bffb2a90f58678907b5e49f7330711eaf4fc"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "1349": {"changesets": [{"author": "Andrew McCreight \u003ccontinuation@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2050990 - Call JS_NumberValue in ClientWebGLContext.cpp.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D309205\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D309810\n", "files": ["dom/canvas/ClientWebGLContext.cpp"], "git_node": "61a2a201dd2d0796691f39434eddd24d0e2490e0", "git_parents": ["8bc2bffb2a90f58678907b5e49f7